{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a short-term night shift chef working hard in a school cafeteria. I heard that there is a shocking urban legend nearby, and the &quot;Flayer&quot; player needs to face the terrifying events that occur, persist until the end of the short-term work, collect fragmented information to advance the plot, and uncover the truth behind hidden and bizarre events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/71d4dccdead19cae9a9e8e6715671f56.poster.avif?t=1755828805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/71d4dccdead19cae9a9e8e6715671f56.webm?t=1755828805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/71d4dccdead19cae9a9e8e6715671f56.mp4?t=1755828805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the scorching summer, we provide services to customers at night. Put the ingredients into the pot. Customers sometimes want to drink something, so you have to prepare soda and ice cream for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/ed53e8013c1e8ab21c6f8ee943ad2847.poster.avif?t=1755828805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/ed53e8013c1e8ab21c6f8ee943ad2847.webm?t=1755828805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953720/extras/ed53e8013c1e8ab21c6f8ee943ad2847.mp4?t=1755828805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu